description: Never add Cursor co-author or Made-with attribution to git commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to commits, commit messages, or pull request bodies.

If a commit somehow includes those trailers, strip them before pushing (rewrite the message / history as needed).
